            "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
            "body": "I'd like to pick this up.\n\n`nvim_win_set_height`/`nvim_win_set_width` are both `FUNC_API_SINCE(1)`.\n\nI propose a new API `nvim_win_resize(win, {height, width, anchor})` which picks a fixed anchor and can default to the current behavior.\nAnd we can enable `resize up +n` with the new API.\n\nDoes it sound OK before I open a PR? @justinmk\n",
